summary:
Green Bay is always a special stop for me. Most of you don’t know but my first ever game I ever worked in my life was 1999 doing sidelines for WCBS in New York, Jets vs Packers. Could you imagine…  first ever game is at Lambeau Field!!!!! I wasn’t nervous, instead I just kept telling myself how great i would feel after I nailed my first hit!

Very, veryyyy grateful for it all. Thank you GOD for the journey. 
@nflonfox #packers #trainingcamp #nfl

